{"type":"text","timestamp":1794319129259,"sessionID":"ses_e3a41e784ffewW0a3KF7BSFPAW","part":{"id":"prt_1c5c11a9f001tP8fngn8m0GyoX","messageID":"msg_1c5c10ffa001GAzwGcxuhK15hQ","sessionID":"ses_e3a41e784ffewW0a3KF7BSFPAW","type":"text","text":"<think>Also the logout endpoint imports delete_session inside the function — let me move it to the top-level import for cleanliness.\n\nAlso I should double-check: `g.current_token` is set in `current_user()`. Good.\n\nLet me fix the import.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794319129247,"end":1794319129257}}}
