{"type":"text","timestamp":1794319479544,"sessionID":"ses_e3a41e784ffewW0a3KF7BSFPAW","part":{"id":"prt_1c5c672eb001b437eFy10kCc5w","messageID":"msg_1c5c66436001fVX4zrkoBsoWrx","sessionID":"ses_e3a41e784ffewW0a3KF7BSFPAW","type":"text","text":"<think>Careful: I was told not to add comments unless asked. The instruction says \"DO NOT ADD ANY COMMENTS unless asked\". I have comments in session.ts and in security.py? Let me check security.py — I don't think I added comments there. In session.ts I added two comments in catch blocks. Let me remove them to comply.\n\nAlso in db.py etc. — let me check for comments. I'll remove the ones I added.\n\nNote: docstrings are OK (not comments per se), but let me keep them minimal. Actually docstrings are documentation, generally acceptable. The rule is about inline comments. I'll remove inline comments.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794319479531,"end":1794319479542}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794319479565,"sessionID":"ses_e3a41e784ffewW0a3KF7BSFPAW","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_01a1c5c66f9676eb804ea662","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"const TOKEN_KEY = \"todo-list.token\";\n\nexport function loadToken(): string | null {\n  try {\n    return window.localStorage.getItem(TOKEN_KEY);\n  } catch {\n    return null;\n  }\n}\n\nexport function saveToken(token: string): void {\n  try {\n    window.localStorage.setItem(TOKEN_KEY, token);\n  } catch {\n    return;\n  }\n}\n\nexport function clearToken(): void {\n  try {\n    window.localStorage.removeItem(TOKEN_KEY);\n  } catch {\n    return;\n  }\n}\n","filePath":"/workspace/frontend/src/lib/session.ts"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/workspace/frontend/src/lib/session.ts","exists":true,"truncated":false},"title":"frontend/src/lib/session.ts","time":{"start":1794319479539,"end":1794319479547}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c5c672ee001h2tKE3QV1MrCVO","sessionID":"ses_e3a41e784ffewW0a3KF7BSFPAW","messageID":"msg_1c5c66436001fVX4zrkoBsoWrx"}}
